{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"赋值判别法"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"赋值判别法"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>设 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"映射.\n对所有"},{"Local":{"url":"赋值环","text":"赋值环"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 及其"},{"Local":{"url":"分式域","text":"分式域"}},{"Plain":" $K$, 考虑提升问题\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}K &amp; \\to &amp; X\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    \\operatorname{Spec}A &amp; \\to &amp; Y,\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n则</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$f$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"泛闭映射","text":"泛闭映射"}},{"Plain":"当且仅当该提升问题总有解;</li>\n<li>在 $f$ 拟分离的假设下, $f$ "},{"Local":{"url":"分离态射","text":"分离"}},{"Plain":"当且仅当该提升问题至多有一个解.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}